OL,3,GNEWSAHeritage railway to launch track
OL,4,Aextension
OL,5,
OL,6,FA heritage railway in East Yorkshire is
OL,7,Fmarking a new route extension with a
OL,8,Fspecial event which will see a train
OL,9,Frun on a track section for the first
OL,10,Ftime since the 1950s.
OL,12,FThe Yorkshire Wolds Railway, which
OL,13,Fopened in May 2015, operates from the
OL,14,Fvillage of Fimber along a section of
OL,15,Fthe former Malton and Driffield
OL,16,FJunction Railway.
OL,18,FWork to extend the route began in April
OL,19,Fand the longer journey will now take
OL,20,Fpassengers along part of the original
OL,21,Frailway's track bed.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
