OL,3,GNEWSAHeritage railway to launch track
OL,4,Aextension
OL,5,
OL,6,FIvan Merino, infrastructure director,
OL,7,Fsaid: "It's very exciting to be able to
OL,8,Flaunch this section of track. Our
OL,9,Fmembers have worked in all weathers to
OL,10,Fget extension finished and have done a
OL,11,Fgreat job."
